@owner: mason
@stability: stable
@since: 2026-06-09
@reviewed: 2026-10-15

Feature: Remove Endpoint Command
  "CLI handler for mason rm: remove one share endpoint (path or slug)."

  Provides:
    - cli.newRmCommand @source("symbol:newRmCommand")
    - cli.defaultRmRun @source("symbol:defaultRmRun")

  Consumes:
    - links.Service.Remove
    - cli.shareStack
    - output.WriteJSON

  Invariants:
    - Human output MUST report share removal and blob orphan hints when applicable
    - Quiet mode MUST emit no stdout on success
    - JSON output MUST use the stable rmJSON shape under output.Success

  Scenario (happy-path): Remove endpoint
    Given a successful remove result
    When renderRm runs without --json
    Then stdout reports the removed ref

  Scenario (negative): Remove failure
    Given Remove returns an error
    When the command runs
    Then emitError renders the failure
